<cl=A2A2A2>
Hunters do not accept people with too high a degree into the guild because
They don't like magic. When they have to engage in magical experiments, with their
poor knowledge of the elements, it rarely turns out something good. Also hunters do not
they are distinguished by special strength and endurance. But the years of hunting are not in vain, and
Hunters are the best marksmen of the Sphere! In addition, constantly dealing with
different monsters, hunters have mastered the skill of protection from both combat and
from magical attacks.
These warriors know how and where to strike to cause the most damage.
This skill is called "squirrel eye".
Accustomed to constant travel in search of prey and able to follow the most
of fleet-footed animals, hunters, if desired, can develop a truly impressive
running speed. Only hunters manage to put two in a regular crossbow at once
Arrows and not to be swung away!

